§ `33(3C), (3D): consumption of a psychoactive substance`

`no previous consumption` MEANS `Antecedent Facts` WITH
    `the offence was committed on or after 1 April 2019` IS FALSE
    `the accused has a previous conviction under section 8(a) or 11I(1)(a)` IS FALSE
    `the accused has a previous conviction under section 8(b), 11I(1)(b), 31(2) or 31A(2)` IS FALSE
    `the accused has a previous conviction under section 8(b) or 31(2)` IS FALSE
    `the accused has a previous conviction under section 11I(1)(b) or 31A(2)` IS FALSE
    `the accused has a previous admission under section 34(2) to an approved institution` IS FALSE
    `the accused has a previous conviction for consumption of a controlled drug or psychoactive substance under section 34 of the Singapore Armed Forces Act 1972` IS FALSE
    `the accused has a previous conviction under section 5(1), 7, 11F(1) or 11H(1)` IS FALSE
    `the accused is 21 years of age or older` IS FALSE
    `the intended recipient of the controlled drug is a young person or a vulnerable person` IS FALSE
    `the gathering consists of a young person or a vulnerable person` IS FALSE
    `the number of the accused's previous admissions` IS 0
    `the number of the accused's previous convictions for consumption of a specified drug under section 8(b)` IS 0
    `the number of the accused's previous convictions for failure to provide a urine specimen under section 31(2)` IS 0
    `the number of the accused's previous convictions for failure to provide a hair specimen under section 31A(2)` IS 0
