§ `33B. discretion of the court not to impose the sentence of death`

`33B certified courier` MEANS `Section 33B Facts` WITH
    `the person is convicted of an offence under section 5(1) or 7, or of attempting to commit one, punishable with death under the sixth column of the Second Schedule` IS TRUE
    `the person proves on a balance of probabilities that his or her involvement was restricted to transporting, sending or delivering a controlled drug, offering to do so, doing or offering to do an act preparatory to or for the purpose of doing so, or any combination of them` IS TRUE
    `the Public Prosecutor certifies to a court that, in his or her determination, the person has substantively assisted the Central Narcotics Bureau in disrupting drug trafficking activities within or outside Singapore` IS TRUE
    `the person proves on a balance of probabilities that he or she was suffering from such abnormality of mind as substantially impaired his or her mental responsibility for his or her acts and omissions in relation to the offence` IS FALSE

`33B courier with abnormality of mind` MEANS `Section 33B Facts` WITH
    `the person is convicted of an offence under section 5(1) or 7, or of attempting to commit one, punishable with death under the sixth column of the Second Schedule` IS TRUE
    `the person proves on a balance of probabilities that his or her involvement was restricted to transporting, sending or delivering a controlled drug, offering to do so, doing or offering to do an act preparatory to or for the purpose of doing so, or any combination of them` IS TRUE
    `the Public Prosecutor certifies to a court that, in his or her determination, the person has substantively assisted the Central Narcotics Bureau in disrupting drug trafficking activities within or outside Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the person proves on a balance of probabilities that he or she was suffering from such abnormality of mind as substantially impaired his or her mental responsibility for his or her acts and omissions in relation to the offence` IS TRUE

`33B courier with both` MEANS `Section 33B Facts` WITH
    `the person is convicted of an offence under section 5(1) or 7, or of attempting to commit one, punishable with death under the sixth column of the Second Schedule` IS TRUE
    `the person proves on a balance of probabilities that his or her involvement was restricted to transporting, sending or delivering a controlled drug, offering to do so, doing or offering to do an act preparatory to or for the purpose of doing so, or any combination of them` IS TRUE
    `the Public Prosecutor certifies to a court that, in his or her determination, the person has substantively assisted the Central Narcotics Bureau in disrupting drug trafficking activities within or outside Singapore` IS TRUE
    `the person proves on a balance of probabilities that he or she was suffering from such abnormality of mind as substantially impaired his or her mental responsibility for his or her acts and omissions in relation to the offence` IS TRUE

`33B certified, not a courier` MEANS `Section 33B Facts` WITH
    `the person is convicted of an offence under section 5(1) or 7, or of attempting to commit one, punishable with death under the sixth column of the Second Schedule` IS TRUE
    `the person proves on a balance of probabilities that his or her involvement was restricted to transporting, sending or delivering a controlled drug, offering to do so, doing or offering to do an act preparatory to or for the purpose of doing so, or any combination of them` IS FALSE
    `the Public Prosecutor certifies to a court that, in his or her determination, the person has substantively assisted the Central Narcotics Bureau in disrupting drug trafficking activities within or outside Singapore` IS TRUE
    `the person proves on a balance of probabilities that he or she was suffering from such abnormality of mind as substantially impaired his or her mental responsibility for his or her acts and omissions in relation to the offence` IS FALSE

`33B courier, nothing more` MEANS `Section 33B Facts` WITH
    `the person is convicted of an offence under section 5(1) or 7, or of attempting to commit one, punishable with death under the sixth column of the Second Schedule` IS TRUE
    `the person proves on a balance of probabilities that his or her involvement was restricted to transporting, sending or delivering a controlled drug, offering to do so, doing or offering to do an act preparatory to or for the purpose of doing so, or any combination of them` IS TRUE
    `the Public Prosecutor certifies to a court that, in his or her determination, the person has substantively assisted the Central Narcotics Bureau in disrupting drug trafficking activities within or outside Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the person proves on a balance of probabilities that he or she was suffering from such abnormality of mind as substantially impaired his or her mental responsibility for his or her acts and omissions in relation to the offence` IS FALSE

`33B not convicted of a capital offence` MEANS `Section 33B Facts` WITH
    `the person is convicted of an offence under section 5(1) or 7, or of attempting to commit one, punishable with death under the sixth column of the Second Schedule` IS FALSE
    `the person proves on a balance of probabilities that his or her involvement was restricted to transporting, sending or delivering a controlled drug, offering to do so, doing or offering to do an act preparatory to or for the purpose of doing so, or any combination of them` IS TRUE
    `the Public Prosecutor certifies to a court that, in his or her determination, the person has substantively assisted the Central Narcotics Bureau in disrupting drug trafficking activities within or outside Singapore` IS TRUE
    `the person proves on a balance of probabilities that he or she was suffering from such abnormality of mind as substantially impaired his or her mental responsibility for his or her acts and omissions in relation to the offence` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the sentence where the sixth column punishment is death` `33B certified courier` EQUALS `The court may impose imprisonment for life and not fewer than 15 strokes of the cane instead (section 33B(1)(a))`

#ASSERT `the sentence where the sixth column punishment is death` `33B courier with abnormality of mind` EQUALS `The court must impose imprisonment for life instead (section 33B(1)(b))`

#ASSERT `the sentence where the sixth column punishment is death` `33B courier with both` EQUALS `The court must impose imprisonment for life instead (section 33B(1)(b))`

#ASSERT `the sentence where the sixth column punishment is death` `33B certified, not a courier` EQUALS `The sentence of death stands`

#ASSERT `the sentence where the sixth column punishment is death` `33B courier, nothing more` EQUALS `The sentence of death stands`

#ASSERT REFUSED `the sentence where the sixth column punishment is death` `33B not convicted of a capital offence`

§ `The quantity bands: boundaries`

`band 330 to 500` MEANS `Quantity Band` WITH
    `lower bound in grammes` IS 330
    `lower bound is inclusive` IS TRUE
    `upper bound in grammes` IS 500
    `upper bound is inclusive` IS TRUE
    `morphine in the opium, lower bound in grammes` IS 0
    `morphine in the opium, lower bound is inclusive` IS FALSE

`band more than 500` MEANS `Quantity Band` WITH
    `lower bound in grammes` IS 500
    `lower bound is inclusive` IS FALSE
    `upper bound in grammes` IS 0
    `upper bound is inclusive` IS FALSE
    `morphine in the opium, lower bound in grammes` IS 0
    `morphine in the opium, lower bound is inclusive` IS FALSE

`band less than 330` MEANS `Quantity Band` WITH
    `lower bound in grammes` IS 0
    `lower bound is inclusive` IS FALSE
    `upper bound in grammes` IS 330
    `upper bound is inclusive` IS FALSE
    `morphine in the opium, lower bound in grammes` IS 0
    `morphine in the opium, lower bound is inclusive` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the quantity falls within the band` `band 330 to 500` 330 0

#ASSERT `the quantity falls within the band` `band 330 to 500` 500 0

#ASSERT NOT `the quantity falls within the band` `band 330 to 500` 329.9 0

#ASSERT NOT `the quantity falls within the band` `band 330 to 500` 500.1 0

#ASSERT `the quantity falls within the band` `band more than 500` 500.1 0

#ASSERT NOT `the quantity falls within the band` `band more than 500` 500 0

#ASSERT `the quantity falls within the band` `band less than 330` 329.9 0

#ASSERT NOT `the quantity falls within the band` `band less than 330` 330 0

#ASSERT NOT `the quantity falls within the band` `band less than 330` 0 0
